    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "My name is Sofia. I am fourteen years old and I live in Madrid, Spain. I live with my mother, my father and my little brother. My brother's name is Leo. He is six years old."
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "My father is a taxi driver. He works at night and sleeps in the morning. My mother is a nurse. She works in a hospital near our house. She starts work at seven o'clock and finishes at three o'clock."
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "We have a small dog called Bruno. He is brown and white. Bruno likes to run in the park, and he likes cheese! Every day I take him for a walk before school. Leo helps me."
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "On Sundays we visit my grandparents. They live in a village near the mountains. My grandmother cooks fish and rice for us. After lunch, my grandfather plays the guitar and we all sing. It is my favourite day of the week."
      }
    ]
